			Dolopians</i>, <i>and father of Phœnix</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Ov. M.
				8, 307</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. H. 3, 27</span></i>.—Hence,
				<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ămyn-tŏrĭdes</span></b> ,
			ae, m., <i>son of
